    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.32,
      383.52,
      299.08,
      441.59
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub - section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the landAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the followingland/servitude* which is required for a public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.32,
      455.52,
      298.46,
      477.59
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to beacquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.32,
      491.52,
      299.06,
      561.59
    ],
    "text": "The land named as Batadombagahawatta in total extentof 0.0010 Hectare (A: 0 R: 0 P : 0.3955) marked as lot No.1 inPreliminary Plan bearing No. B.P.G. 4336 made by SurveyorGeneral situated in the Village of Gonapinuwala, in theDivisional Secretariat Gonapinuwala, District of Galle. Theboundaries of the land are as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.32,
      575.52,
      298.82,
      633.59
    ],
    "text": "North : Road (R.D.A) and Lot No. 57 depicted inPreliminary Plan No. G. 3857; East : Lot No. 57 depicted inPreliminary Plan No. G. 3857 and Batadombagahawattaclaimed by P.D.R. Dewasiri and J.A. Wijewickrama; South:Batadombagahawatta claimed by J.A. Wijewickrama,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      322.56,
      561.9,
      356.63
    ],
    "text": "Batapolagewatta claimed by Wimal Thilaka Pinnaduwa andLot No. 58 depicted in Preliminary Plan No. G. 3857; West: LotNo. 58 depicted in Preliminary Plan No. G. 3857 (R.D.A.).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      373.68,
      562.08,
      500.63
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat the Divisional Secretariat Gonapinuwala on the 26th day ofDecember 2018 at 10.00 a.m and are herebyrequested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or beforethe 26th day of December 2018, the nature of their interests inthe land, the particulars of their claims for compensation andthe details of the said land/servitude*, the amount of com-pensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
